 "The size of one instance per band ",
 StyleBox["{r, r + 1}", "TI"],
 " about the centre of the square grid, as points, against the count of the \
band, as a curve."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"671e9dfd-b4fe-4056-a6e8-8fa04adaf521"],

